<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V INDIA TRIANGULAR SERIES FINAL ABANDONED.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V INDIA TRIANGULAR SERIES FINAL ABANDONED.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The triangular series final</p>
<p>between South Africa and India was abandoned on Wednesday</p>
<p>because of rain.</p>
<p>Scores: India 191-9 in 50 overs. South Africa 42-1 after</p>
<p>14.3 overs.</p>
<p>The match will be re-played from the start on Thursday.</p>
</text>
